assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/be6b735e9a252e210d379c686d99d00c.avif?t=1784519208\" width=600 height=185 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Battlefields &amp; Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize elemental offense to exploit weaknesses: Machines are vulnerable to electricity, and biological enemies fear fire. Gain combat advantage by using environmental objects!<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/9820ef261b940340bf7ea632fc03ce19.poster.avif?t=1784519208\" width=1068 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/9820ef261b940340bf7ea632fc03ce19.webm?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/9820ef261b940340bf7ea632fc03ce19.mp4?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Boss Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These powerful entities are equal in strength to the player characters. They can also accumulate energy and unleash Overdrive Burst attacks. To counter their powerful offensive, focus your attacks during the openings between their moves to break their 'Stance', interrupt their offense, and gain the upper hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/d5d01fc0b063aefea83642a579c2289a.poster.avif?t=1784519208\" width=1068 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/d5d01fc0b063aefea83642a579c2289a.webm?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/d5d01fc0b063aefea83642a579c2289a.mp4?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/291db2978ce3d40377f77ae50d0489e5.avif?t=1784519208\" width=600 height=185 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Rich Content &amp; Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 50+ Tech Arts and special actions per character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Customize performance via flexible Chip layouts — multi-air-jump / infinite energy / multiple HP layers, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Collect all Support allies to enhance tactical depth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Dozens of enemy types and diverse BOSS encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Battle Rush Mode includes hundreds of upgrades for destructive power escalation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether playing solo or co-op, you’ll enjoy fast-paced, thrilling action every time you start the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/4f2f5c7a7c3242bd535630162326fcf4.poster.avif?t=1784519208\" width=1068 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/4f2f5c7a7c3242bd535630162326fcf4.webm?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/4f2f5c7a7c3242bd535630162326fcf4.mp4?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/32e8d66f2f07031d0ddf0e2f7a289eda.poster.avif?t=1784519208\" width=1068 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/32e8d66f2f07031d0ddf0e2f7a289eda.webm?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/extras/32e8d66f2f07031d0ddf0e2f7a289eda.mp4?t=1784519208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Super Alloy Crush is a fast-paced 2D roguelike brawler inspired by classics like Mega Man X. Play as Kelly and Muu (No.02) to defeat enemies and obtain the ultimate cosmic treasure: Planet AE-38. Alone or with a friend in local co-op, get ready for your biggest challenge yet!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/6fb6ebbead0b01cf064cdde61304a3a5b1ff28f8/header.jpg?t=1784519208", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/80d026d2961782d28e7bc2f4ccc0c23de1660f7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784519208", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092360/80d026d2961782d28e7bc2f4ccc0c23de1660f7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784519208", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 450 GTS / Radeon HD 5750 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Alloy Mushroom"], "publishers": ["Alloy Mushroom"], "demos": [{"appid": 3092480, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1